<span class="ls-principle-index">03 /</span>
<h3>START WITH FAMILIAR WORK.</h3>
<p>Begin with a brief, a budget or a plan you already care about. A source-backed update or a chart that redraws can leave more room for the next question. Small responsibilities are how a larger ambition becomes practical.</p>
</article>
